rence text states reading the status code costs one comparison.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-045\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A cap can be raised\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-046\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the number of caps raised without a measurement behind them is 0\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-047\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The platform team looks at whether the load is smooth or bursty before it looks at the number at all\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the team looks at smooth versus bursty load in considering increases.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-048\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a burst is cheaper to smooth than it is to serve at its peak\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-049\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A caller that can move half its work to a quieter hour usually gets what it needs without any change to the cap at all\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-050\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Requests reach the platform team through the usual channel\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-051\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"they are answered within two working days\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states requests are answered within two working days.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-052\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"There is no expedited path\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states there is no expedited path.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-053\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\