dy names the cap, tier and window as plain fields.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-025\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"None of those fields is a substitute for the header\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-026\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The body is there so that a human reading a log afterwards can see why the request was refused\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the body is for a human reading the log.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-027\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Four rules, given in the order they should be applied.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states there are four rules.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-028\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Four rules, given in the order they should be applied.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the rules are given in the order they should be applied.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-029\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Honour the header, every time, and do not compute your own wait.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-030\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The gateway has already done that arithmetic, with information the caller does not have\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the same meaning.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-031\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"it does the same on the 503 path\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The gateway computing the wait on the 503 path means the honour-the-header rule holds there too.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-032\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"even though the cause of that refusal is an entirely different one\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the 503 cause is entirely different.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-033\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A wait derived on the client side is a guess about a counter it cannot see.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states a client-side wait is a guess.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-034\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Retry only what is safe to retry\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-035\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"which is a smaller set than the set of responses that are not a success\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-036\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A 200 wants nothing\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the same meaning.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-037\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a 429 wants the stated wait\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the same meaning.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-038\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a 500 may be retried once that wait has passed\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states the same meaning.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-039\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"a 503 means the platform itself is overloaded\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference text states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-040\",\"verdict\":\"PARTIAL\",\"evidence\":\"A client that folds every non-success into one branch will retry hardest during exactly the incident the cap was installed to survive.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states this for folding every non-success into one branch; it does not state it for a branch that also includes 200.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-041\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"A batch credential is allowed 1000 requests in a window\",\"evidence_sourc